---
grainfile: v1
title: Audit widget schema changes on {{ target_branch | default("main") | trim }}
when:
  push:
    branches:
      - {{ target_branch | default("main") | trim }}
    paths:
      - "src/**"
gate: {{ enforce_gate | default("false") }}
references:
  - /docs/widget-schema.md
  - /src/widget.go
---
{# Self-contained Jinja2 process template for branch audit #}
Audit commits pushed to `{{ target_branch | default("main") | trim }}` touching `src/**` against `/docs/widget-schema.md`.
